</script>  <section class="preview-intro"> <div class="container"> <h1>Industries section — three redesign directions.</h1> <p>House painters added to all three. Pick one, I'll ship it.</p> </div> </section>  <section class="concept" id="a"> <div class="container"> <div class="concept-tag">Concept A · Card Grid</div> <h2>Every trade, equal weight.</h2> <p class="concept-desc">Flat 4-column grid. All 13 trades visible at once. Each card is self-contained, hover lifts, clicks anywhere on the card.</p> <div class="grid-a"> <a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L6 10h3l-4 6h4l-4 6h14l-4-6h4l-4-6h3z"/><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="18"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Tree services</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Highest-intent vertical in home services. Emergency work alone usually pays for the marketing.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Removal</span><span class="card-a-chip">Pruning</span><span class="card-a-chip">Stump grinding</span><span class="card-a-chip">Emergency</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 20l5-9 4 5 3-4 6 8z"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="1.5"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Land management</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Big-ticket jobs with low search competition. The right pages and ads can dominate a 60-mile radius.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Forestry mulching</span><span class="card-a-chip">Clearing</span><span class="card-a-chip">Grading</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 4 14 11 14 10 22 20 9 13 9 13 2"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Electrical</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Mix of emergency, service, and big install work. Clear service pages convert calls fast.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Service</span><span class="card-a-chip">Repairs</span><span class="card-a-chip">Panel upgrades</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.5c4 5.5 6.5 9 6.5 12.5a6.5 6.5 0 0 1-13 0c0-3.5 2.5-7 6.5-12.5z"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Plumbing</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Steady call volume and clear emergency intent. The fundamentals win this trade most of the time.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Service</span><span class="card-a-chip">Drain cleaning</span><span class="card-a-chip">Water heaters</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8h13a3 3 0 1 0-3-3"/><path d="M3 16h17a3 3 0 1 1-3 3"/><path d="M3 12h11a3 3 0 1 1-3 3"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">HVAC</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Seasonal spikes and high install value. Lead generation has to be on before the heat or the cold hits.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Service</span><span class="card-a-chip">Install</span><span class="card-a-chip">Heat pumps</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19.2 2.96c1.4 9.3 4.8 15.4-4.4 18.8z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Landscaping</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Design-build and maintenance both convert well online. We split campaigns to match how customers actually search.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Design</span><span class="card-a-chip">Hardscapes</span><span class="card-a-chip">Maintenance</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11l9-8 9 8"/><path d="M5 9.5V21h14V9.5"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Roofing</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Storm season is a sprint. We build campaigns that are ready before the storm and still working after the leads dry up.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Replacement</span><span class="card-a-chip">Repair</span><span class="card-a-chip">Storm restoration</span><span class="card-a-chip">Gutters</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 20h20"/><path d="M5 20l3-7 4 2 3-5 4 3v7"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="20" r="1.5"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Grading &amp; excavation</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">High-ticket commercial and residential work. The site has to qualify leads or you waste days on bad jobs.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Site prep</span><span class="card-a-chip">Driveways</span><span class="card-a-chip">Demolition</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="1"/><line x1="3" y1="8" x2="21" y2="8"/><line x1="3" y1="13" x2="21" y2="13"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Garage doors</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Emergency repair plus high-margin installs. Phone-call volume is the whole game in this trade.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Springs</span><span class="card-a-chip">Openers</span><span class="card-a-chip">Panels</span><span class="card-a-chip">Install</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 4v3a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h3"/><rect x="13" y="11" width="9" height="3" rx="0.5"/><path d="M3 14l5-3"/><path d="M3 17l5-2"/><path d="M3 20l5-1"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Pressure washing</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Easy to start, hard to scale. We stack recurring fleet and HOA contracts on top of one-off residential.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Residential</span><span class="card-a-chip">Fleet washing</span><span class="card-a-chip">HOA contracts</span><span class="card-a-chip">Soft wash</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-a-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/><line x1="3" y1="14" x2="21" y2="14"/><path d="M5 8l1-3 1 3v14"/><path d="M9 8l1-3 1 3v14"/><path d="M13 8l1-3 1 3v14"/><path d="M17 8l1-3 1 3v14"/></svg></div> <div class="card-a-name">Fencing</div> <div class="card-a-tagline">Quote-driven business with long sales cycles. The site has to qualify the lead so you are not driving to dead ones.</div> <div class="card-a-chips"> <span class="card-a-chip">Wood</span><span class="card-a-chip">Vinyl</span><span class="card-a-chip">Chain link</span><span class="card-a-chip">Repairs</span> </div> </a><a href="#contact" class="card-a"> <div class="card-